WEBVTT

00:01.860 --> 00:02.480
Take this!

00:02.710 --> 00:04.240
Why me?!

00:04.830 --> 00:05.900
Gotcha!

00:06.460 --> 00:08.460
M-Miyo-chan!

00:11.590 --> 00:13.480
You guys were wide open!

00:15.540 --> 00:17.400
<i>H-How could this happen?</i>

00:18.630 --> 00:22.460
<i>How could such a wonderful 
night turn out this way?</i>

00:35.710 --> 00:36.800
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

00:37.300 --> 00:38.430
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

00:40.590 --> 00:43.720
<b>Mahiro Oyama</b>

00:46.890 --> 00:49.940
<b>Mihari Oyama</b>

01:44.740 --> 01:53.080
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

01:54.620 --> 01:57.590
Winter break rules!

01:58.080 --> 02:01.410
After many trials and tribulations, 
through thick and thin,

01:58.170 --> 02:03.090
<b>#08  Mahiro's First Girls Sleepover</b>

02:01.410 --> 02:04.060
I've finally reached paradise.

02:05.600 --> 02:09.640
Now I can slack off to my heart's content!

02:10.740 --> 02:13.190
I knew long breaks from 
school would pose an issue.

02:13.690 --> 02:16.340
He'll be back to his old 
ways if I don't step in.

02:17.660 --> 02:18.810
I've got it!

02:19.740 --> 02:20.490
Chitose Azuma

02:19.740 --> 02:20.490
Kaede Hozuki

02:20.490 --> 02:22.740
Kaede

02:20.780 --> 02:22.740
You're welcome.

02:20.780 --> 02:22.740
Thank you so much!

02:20.780 --> 02:22.740
Don't mention it.
Well, I'm gonna
head to bed now.
Goodnight!

02:20.780 --> 02:22.740
Goodnight!

02:20.780 --> 02:22.740
Onii-chan | I'm | Kaede | Okay

02:21.030 --> 02:21.900
Can Momiji-chan and

02:21.900 --> 02:22.610
Can Momiji-chan and

02:22.610 --> 02:22.740
Can Momiji-chan and

02:29.400 --> 02:31.420
All right!

02:31.420 --> 02:35.780
Break won't last forever, so 
I'd better make the best of it.

02:35.780 --> 02:36.970
Okay.

02:36.970 --> 02:39.330
Time to plan out my schedule with a graph.

02:42.310 --> 02:44.710
I'll wanna sleep in late in the mornings,

02:44.710 --> 02:46.880
and have plenty of chill time 
in the evenings, too.

02:46.880 --> 02:48.440
So with that in mind...

02:48.430 --> 02:51.850
Anime

02:48.430 --> 02:51.850
Sleep

02:48.430 --> 02:51.850
Eat

02:48.430 --> 02:51.850
Video 
Games

02:48.430 --> 02:51.850
Eat

02:48.430 --> 02:51.850
Manga

02:51.850 --> 02:54.120
I-It's perfect.

02:54.120 --> 02:55.530
Well, without further ado!

02:55.530 --> 02:58.940
It's time to play nothing but video 
games from now until dinner!

02:58.940 --> 03:01.380
That's no different from 
what you normally do.

03:01.790 --> 03:04.220
It is the will of Gaia that 
I indulge in this way.

03:04.940 --> 03:08.490
It shall be named my Winter Vacation Mode!

03:09.320 --> 03:10.940
Honestly...

03:30.590 --> 03:32.750
M-Mihari?

03:32.750 --> 03:34.340
You wanna play with me?

03:35.150 --> 03:36.690
Not today.

03:43.280 --> 03:45.250
Oh, that must be them!

03:49.580 --> 03:51.450
There's funny business afoot.

03:51.980 --> 03:53.870
Thanks for having us!

03:53.870 --> 03:55.300
Wassup?

03:55.300 --> 03:56.730
Hey there!

03:57.630 --> 04:00.010
It's an ambush!

04:00.830 --> 04:03.270
Y-You plan on dragging me 
outside again, don't you?!

04:03.270 --> 04:05.080
I won't go along with it this time, okay?!

04:05.080 --> 04:08.440
But I thought we were 
having a sleepover today.

04:09.260 --> 04:10.010
Huh?

04:10.560 --> 04:12.770
Weren't you the one who 
suggested it, Mahiro-chan?

04:12.770 --> 04:14.600
We're coming in!

04:15.430 --> 04:17.500
A... sleepover?

04:18.970 --> 04:20.110
Wh-When did I say—

04:20.110 --> 04:22.670
I brought my PJs and everything!

04:24.520 --> 04:25.910
I brought mine too.

04:25.910 --> 04:27.060
Same here!

04:27.060 --> 04:27.930
Oh?

04:29.490 --> 04:32.360
Were you playing a game, Mahiro-chan?

04:32.360 --> 04:33.880
Ooo!

04:33.880 --> 04:36.290
Can we play too, Mahiron?! Can we?!

04:36.290 --> 04:38.290
Yeah, of course!

04:38.290 --> 04:42.030
Oh, but this is only a two-player game...

04:42.030 --> 04:43.280
Ta-da!

04:43.280 --> 04:44.210
And now...

04:43.280 --> 04:48.130
Your big sis comes to 
the rescue with a gift!

04:44.210 --> 04:48.130
<b>Kozy Kart</b>

04:48.130 --> 04:50.150
Whoa!

04:50.830 --> 04:52.060
You go, Mihari!

04:54.850 --> 04:55.980
Whoa, that was close!

04:57.540 --> 04:59.620
Oh yeah, it's bomb time!

04:59.890 --> 05:01.300
I can just dodge it, you know?

05:03.880 --> 05:06.340
Oh, no! I'm gonna get hit!

05:06.780 --> 05:08.980
Go, go, go!

05:13.650 --> 05:15.550
Dinner's ready!

05:15.910 --> 05:17.480
Coming!

05:21.450 --> 05:22.680
<i>Onimai.</i>

05:21.790 --> 05:23.590
<b>ONIMAI</b>

05:27.900 --> 05:30.440
Thanks for dinner!

05:31.400 --> 05:34.710
You're such a good cook, Doc!

05:34.710 --> 05:36.710
I told you I'm not a doctor.

05:36.710 --> 05:39.600
All right, bring by your empty plates.

05:43.540 --> 05:46.100
You heard her, Mahiron.

05:46.100 --> 05:47.770
You lost, remember?

05:51.400 --> 05:54.700
Too bad you were the one who 
suggested these stakes.

05:54.700 --> 05:57.430
Come on, I let them win.

05:58.060 --> 06:00.730
They're our guests, after all.

06:02.500 --> 06:05.370
You seem pretty devastated for 
someone who lost on purpose.

06:05.370 --> 06:08.760
See? Aren't games more 
enjoyable with friends?

06:10.060 --> 06:11.830
Let's play that game again sometime.

06:10.770 --> 06:15.350
Th-That... depends on the game.

06:11.830 --> 06:12.900
Yeah!

06:12.900 --> 06:14.750
It was fun, wasn't it?

06:14.750 --> 06:17.320
I wanna play again.

06:15.350 --> 06:17.420
You could just admit it, you know?

06:18.970 --> 06:20.740
Admit what?

06:23.310 --> 06:24.740
I'm done...

06:24.740 --> 06:25.810
Nice work!

06:25.810 --> 06:27.130
Good job!

06:27.130 --> 06:29.480
So do you wanna keep playing?

06:29.480 --> 06:32.460
It's getting late. We'd 
bother the neighbors, no?

06:32.460 --> 06:35.870
I worked up a sweat too, so I 
kinda wanna take a bath now.

06:35.870 --> 06:37.110
Actually, same.

06:37.580 --> 06:38.820
Hmm...

06:39.310 --> 06:42.490
Well, I don't mind going last, 
so why don't you guys—

06:42.490 --> 06:44.180
Let's go in pairs!

06:44.180 --> 06:46.670
If we go in one at a time, the 
water'll get cold before we're done.

06:48.820 --> 06:51.390
Th-That's a big no-no!

06:51.390 --> 06:52.130
Why's that?

06:52.130 --> 06:54.600
I-It's just... Um...

06:54.600 --> 06:58.650
Come on, Mahiron! I can 
wash your back for you!

06:59.520 --> 07:03.760
I-In that case, I can wash 
your hair for you too!

07:06.760 --> 07:07.520
Uh...

07:08.800 --> 07:10.610
Um...

07:12.070 --> 07:14.700
Come on, you two. Settle down.

07:15.210 --> 07:16.540
Miyo-chan!

07:17.600 --> 07:21.630
How about the OG AsaMomi pairing?

07:22.930 --> 07:23.800
Asa?

07:23.800 --> 07:24.660
Momi?

07:24.660 --> 07:26.890
<i>It's no use! She's been corrupted!</i>

07:28.250 --> 07:32.510
You mean Asahi and I should 
battle each other for it?

07:32.510 --> 07:34.960
Oh! You wanna go?

07:35.700 --> 07:36.580
All right!

07:36.580 --> 07:37.650
Let's rock-paper-scissors!

07:38.330 --> 07:41.210
Hell yeah! I'm going with rock!

07:41.730 --> 07:43.600
Hold it, hold it!

07:44.900 --> 07:48.300
I-I-I'm gonna...

07:57.010 --> 07:58.280
What the—?!

07:58.900 --> 08:01.270
We're getting in together. 
This is your own fault.

08:01.270 --> 08:03.070
H-Huh?!

08:22.050 --> 08:23.820
U-Um...

08:23.820 --> 08:27.100
I don't know how I feel about 
you seeing me this close up...

08:27.990 --> 08:30.220
You've gotten bigger, huh?

08:30.780 --> 08:33.130
Wha?! That's sexual harassment!

08:33.130 --> 08:35.460
That's not what I meant!

08:35.460 --> 08:38.940
We used to bathe together when 
we were little, remember?

08:38.940 --> 08:41.050
I was just reminiscing.

08:47.950 --> 08:50.090
Well, you've gotten smaller.

08:50.090 --> 08:51.270
And whose fault is that?!

08:52.710 --> 08:55.820
The bath is free! You guys can go now!

08:57.120 --> 08:59.360
Wow!

08:59.360 --> 09:01.540
You're so cute, Mahiro-chan!

09:01.860 --> 09:04.960
You smell good too, Mahiron!

09:06.120 --> 09:07.390
Wha?

09:08.550 --> 09:11.330
You're just smelling the shampoo!

09:11.330 --> 09:14.300
Come on, Asahi! It's time for our bath!

09:15.880 --> 09:17.830
Uwaraba!

09:19.420 --> 09:21.410
You too, Miyo-chan!

09:22.060 --> 09:25.080
B-But it'll be too cramped 
with the three of us.

09:26.330 --> 09:29.600
Come on, it's a sleepover. We might as well!

09:35.630 --> 09:37.580
You can wash up first, Miyo-chan.

09:37.580 --> 09:40.120
Me and Momiji will go 
ahead and get in the tub.

09:40.120 --> 09:41.760
O-Okay...

09:54.150 --> 09:56.950
<i>This is like my worst nightmare!</i>

09:57.450 --> 10:01.130
<i>Though getting to see my pairing 
interact up close is a treat.</i>

10:01.720 --> 10:03.300
Blub, blub, blub, blub.

10:03.690 --> 10:04.620
Take this!

10:04.620 --> 10:07.760
It's been so long since we've 
bathed together, huh, Asahi?

10:08.820 --> 10:10.110
Do you remember?

10:10.110 --> 10:11.240
Hm?

10:11.620 --> 10:13.960
Back when we first became friends.

10:17.170 --> 10:18.950
My name's Asahi!

10:20.270 --> 10:22.880
I'm Momiji. Nice to meet you!

10:29.470 --> 10:31.610
It's a topknot! You're a samurai!

10:31.610 --> 10:33.890
Nice to meet you, Momijiro!

10:34.190 --> 10:36.450
Mo-mi-ji!

10:44.810 --> 10:47.440
That's so cool! I wish I had a topknot!

10:47.440 --> 10:49.610
Maybe I should put my hair up too.

10:50.560 --> 10:52.170
You're so weird.

10:52.170 --> 10:53.880
Here, I have an idea.

10:56.810 --> 10:58.800
See? Pretty cute, huh?

11:18.320 --> 11:19.140
Hup!

11:21.740 --> 11:23.000
Take that!

11:25.150 --> 11:26.720
Yay!

11:30.720 --> 11:32.580
Wanna take a bath?

11:32.580 --> 11:33.510
Sure!

11:35.790 --> 11:37.890
Is it okay if we go in together?

11:41.000 --> 11:42.820
Oh! Did you not want to?

11:42.820 --> 11:45.100
N-No, it's okay.

11:45.100 --> 11:47.330
I bathe with my big brother all the time.

11:57.030 --> 11:58.720
Is yours gonna grow in later?

11:58.720 --> 11:59.870
What?

12:03.660 --> 12:07.390
I know we were little, but 
that was still pretty rude.

12:08.250 --> 12:09.850
My goodness.

12:11.350 --> 12:13.860
We used to wash each other too, huh?

12:16.300 --> 12:18.630
May I request a reenactment?!

12:20.180 --> 12:22.390
All right, then, Miyo-chin.

12:22.390 --> 12:23.030
Huh?

12:23.540 --> 12:25.560
C'mere and I'll wash you.

12:25.560 --> 12:28.480
I-I didn't mean me...

12:28.480 --> 12:31.560
Come on, now! Don't be shy!

12:39.190 --> 12:41.450
That actually feels kinda nice...

12:41.450 --> 12:44.650
I used to wash my brother's 
back all the time, you know?

12:47.780 --> 12:49.420
Okay, now reach for the sky!

12:50.540 --> 12:52.020
Gotta get your underarms!

13:15.360 --> 13:17.110
I wasn't expecting that.

13:20.190 --> 13:22.110
<b>ONIMAI</b>

13:20.330 --> 13:21.470
<i>Onimai.</i>

13:24.150 --> 13:26.110
<b>ONIMAI</b>

13:24.770 --> 13:26.120
<i>Onimai.</i>

13:26.110 --> 13:29.530
Mahiro

13:28.350 --> 13:31.130
You really think we should be 
sleeping in the same room?

13:32.220 --> 13:35.200
That's the whole point of a 
sleepover, don't you think?

13:35.200 --> 13:38.880
Or would you rather sleep 
with your big sister too?

13:38.880 --> 13:41.460
I said I'm sorry about the bath thing, okay?

13:41.460 --> 13:43.120
I'm sure it'll be fine.

13:43.120 --> 13:45.530
I know for a fact you're 
harmless, after all.

13:46.070 --> 13:48.840
You say that like I'm some wild animal.

13:56.110 --> 13:58.330
Futons!

14:00.590 --> 14:02.820
This is so exciting!

14:02.820 --> 14:05.650
Asahi! You're in the way!

14:06.860 --> 14:09.970
Was it cramped, being 
in the bath together?

14:09.970 --> 14:11.990
It was totally fine!

14:11.990 --> 14:15.470
Th-Though we did have a small incident...

14:20.000 --> 14:21.130
Wow!

14:21.130 --> 14:23.490
You look so grown-up, Miyo-chan!

14:24.420 --> 14:27.830
I'm an observer, not a participant, okay?!

14:28.170 --> 14:28.980
<i>Huh?</i>

14:29.560 --> 14:32.150
Just try and give her a little space.

14:33.060 --> 14:35.470
<i>What the hell happened in that bath?</i>

14:35.470 --> 14:37.850
Well, you're all set, so have fun.

14:37.850 --> 14:39.760
Don't stay up all night, okay?

14:40.800 --> 14:42.500
See ya later, Doc!

14:42.500 --> 14:43.950
Goodnight!

14:46.520 --> 14:49.230
Okay, what now? What are we doing?!

14:49.230 --> 14:50.260
Whoa, there!

14:50.720 --> 14:53.280
Let's decide who's sleeping where first.

14:54.700 --> 14:56.060
I'll sleep here.

14:56.060 --> 14:58.030
This one's mine, anyway.

14:58.520 --> 15:00.470
Then I'll take the one next to hers!

15:03.280 --> 15:05.160
No fair!

15:05.730 --> 15:07.680
Let's rock-paper-scissors for it this time!

15:08.330 --> 15:11.070
Hell yeah! I'm going with scissors!

15:13.060 --> 15:15.310
Rock, paper, scissors!

15:15.800 --> 15:19.200
It's Asahi. I should have 
known I was overthinking it.

15:19.200 --> 15:21.220
Honesty wins again!

15:21.590 --> 15:23.380
Be careful, Mahiro-chan.

15:23.380 --> 15:25.420
Asahi's a nightmare to sleep next to.

15:25.420 --> 15:28.450
Wha? Really? Aw, man...

15:28.450 --> 15:29.990
I'll be good, I promise.

15:32.620 --> 15:33.810
Take this!

15:35.630 --> 15:37.300
You little...

15:37.300 --> 15:38.760
You've done it now!

15:40.050 --> 15:41.020
Whoops.

15:42.180 --> 15:43.370
Hey...

15:43.370 --> 15:45.710
This isn't a field trip, you know?

15:47.140 --> 15:50.760
That's it!

15:49.180 --> 15:50.420
We got her mad!

15:49.490 --> 15:50.750
Sorry, Mahiro-chan!

16:03.200 --> 16:07.310
Take this! Vanishing pillow!

16:08.290 --> 16:10.540
Keep it down, will you?!

16:13.860 --> 16:13.990
<b>ONIMAI</b>

16:13.990 --> 16:14.150
<b>ONIMAI</b>

16:14.150 --> 16:14.280
<b>ONIMAI</b>

16:14.220 --> 16:15.560
<i>Onimai.</i>

16:14.280 --> 16:14.440
<b>ONIMAI</b>

16:14.440 --> 16:14.610
<b>ONIMAI</b>

16:14.610 --> 16:14.690
<b>ONIMAI</b>

16:14.690 --> 16:14.780
<b>ONIMAI</b>

16:14.780 --> 16:14.860
<b>ONIMAI</b>

16:14.860 --> 16:14.940
<b>ONIMAI</b>

16:14.940 --> 16:15.900
<b>ONIMAI</b>

16:20.360 --> 16:22.440
This is all your fault, Asahi.

16:22.740 --> 16:25.350
You were being loud too, you know?

16:25.350 --> 16:28.110
Let's just try to keep it 
down from now on, okay?

16:30.300 --> 16:31.090
Then...

16:31.450 --> 16:34.430
It's finally time for some girl talk!

16:35.020 --> 16:37.460
Oh, you're back with us, Miyo-chan?

16:37.460 --> 16:40.410
Chatting is the best part of a sleepover!

16:40.410 --> 16:41.940
I see.

16:42.670 --> 16:45.030
Chatting's not really my thing...

16:47.230 --> 16:49.400
Hey, hey! What do you 
guys wanna talk about?

16:49.400 --> 16:51.770
Romance, right? It's gotta be romance.

16:51.770 --> 16:54.720
Well then, allow me to take the lead.

16:54.720 --> 16:55.640
Huh?!

16:56.710 --> 16:58.700
I'll tell you a fearsome tale...

17:00.850 --> 17:03.630
of the Pillow Flipper spirit!

17:05.990 --> 17:10.040
This is a true story of my 
many encounters with it.

17:11.380 --> 17:17.460
Every night, when I'm asleep, 
it appears before my pillow.

17:21.180 --> 17:23.810
Pillow, pillow, pillow...

17:23.810 --> 17:26.960
It takes your pillow from under your head,

17:26.960 --> 17:30.690
and even moves you around in your sleep.

17:41.520 --> 17:43.270
This is girl talk?

17:43.690 --> 17:46.480
That's just a spooky campfire story.

17:51.000 --> 17:52.610
Asahi, you dummy!

17:52.610 --> 17:55.200
Why'd you have to bring 
up such a scary story?!

17:55.200 --> 17:57.800
H-Hey now, weren't you listening?

17:57.800 --> 17:59.340
That wasn't scary at all!

17:59.340 --> 18:01.830
La-la-la! I'm not listening!

18:01.830 --> 18:03.650
I didn't think she'd react <i>this</i> badly...

18:03.650 --> 18:05.780
So you already knew she didn't like them?

18:05.780 --> 18:07.420
That's pretty mean, you know?

18:09.770 --> 18:11.870
I'm going to sleep!

18:11.870 --> 18:13.340
I'm sorry!

18:13.340 --> 18:16.010
Aw! What about our romance talk?

18:16.010 --> 18:18.770
<i>Momiji can be pretty cute 
sometimes too, huh?</i>

18:20.430 --> 18:22.390
I'm turning off the light now!

18:22.390 --> 18:23.990
Okay!

18:40.940 --> 18:43.240
<i>I really need to go to the bathroom...</i>

18:43.930 --> 18:46.280
<i>This is all Asahi's fault!</i>

18:47.140 --> 18:49.450
<i>I'll just have to hold it in till morning.</i>

18:53.940 --> 18:55.110
So cold...

18:58.390 --> 19:00.900
Where'd my comforter go?

19:07.730 --> 19:10.250
She really is a nightmare 
to sleep next to...

19:16.260 --> 19:18.820
It's no use! She's sound asleep!

19:19.560 --> 19:21.940
I'm gonna catch a cold at this rate.

19:25.680 --> 19:27.180
I give up.

19:27.440 --> 19:29.130
Time for an emergency evac.

19:31.840 --> 19:33.920
Momiji...

19:38.940 --> 19:42.110
<b>The Pillow Flipper</b>

19:39.160 --> 19:41.120
<i>The Pillow Flipper?!</i>

19:45.110 --> 19:45.840
Huh?

20:01.350 --> 20:05.170
S-Sorry about that. Really.

20:08.690 --> 20:11.110
D-Don't beat yourself up about it!

20:11.110 --> 20:13.140
It was my fault, anyway.

20:13.460 --> 20:15.110
Just leave the rest to me.

20:15.110 --> 20:18.150
You can head back and use 
my futon instead, okay?

20:18.560 --> 20:20.220
O-Okay...

20:20.220 --> 20:22.480
Where will you sleep, though, Mahiro-chan?

20:23.140 --> 20:24.540
Hmm...

20:25.240 --> 20:25.940
Oh!

20:25.950 --> 20:28.820
Mihari

20:37.430 --> 20:39.160
Wha?! What's going on?

20:39.620 --> 20:40.910
Why are you here?

20:40.910 --> 20:43.090
Please, no questions at this time.

20:47.620 --> 20:49.690
Goodnight!

21:00.350 --> 21:03.360
Wow, this is so embarrassing!

21:04.030 --> 21:07.580
I must have drunk too much 
before bed, you know?

21:09.580 --> 21:11.790
So that's what happened.

21:11.790 --> 21:13.280
Well, you live and you learn.

21:16.460 --> 21:19.390
You didn't have to take the 
blame for me, you know?

21:19.390 --> 21:21.220
No worries, I got you.

21:21.220 --> 21:23.060
It'll be our little secret.

21:23.830 --> 21:25.740
Y-You're sure?

21:28.760 --> 21:30.140
Well, thank you.

21:30.910 --> 21:32.270
It's no biggie.

21:32.270 --> 21:34.190
<i>Interesting. Very interesting.</i>

